<Layout title="About us" description="Nepali Property Market is an independent directory helping the Nepali community in Australia find trusted property professionals.">
	<div class="wrap narrow">
		<div class="page-head"><h1>About Nepali Property Market</h1></div>
		<div class="prose">
			<p>Buying, selling or investing in Australian property is a big step, and it is easier when you can ask questions in your own language and deal with people who understand your situation.</p>
			<p>Nepali Property Market is an independent directory that helps Nepali people across Australia find real estate agents, mortgage brokers, conveyancers, accountants, buyers’ agents and building inspectors who can help in Nepali.</p>
			<h2>How we work</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Browsing and sending enquiries is free for the public.</li>
				<li>Businesses can pay for a featured position. Every paid placement is labelled “Sponsored”.</li>
				<li>We show a “Nepali-speaking” badge only when the business has told us, or shows on its own materials, that it can assist in Nepali.</li>
				<li>We show “Licence checked” only after we have verified a licence on the official register.</li>
				<li>We do not publish reviews or ratings.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What we are not</h2>
			<p>We are not a real estate agency, credit provider, law firm or tax adviser, and we do not give financial, legal or tax advice. Always check a professional’s credentials and get independent advice for major decisions.</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>Questions, corrections or removal requests: <a href="mailto:hello@nepalipropertymarket.com.au">hello@nepalipropertymarket.com.au</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
